## 13. Deferred architecture

The following are explicitly deferred:

- Exact desktop UI technology.
- Exact live capture mechanism.
- Simultaneous capture streams.
- Cloud synchronization.
- Authentication and multi-user access.
- Automatic game-result extraction.
- Advanced computer vision.
- Machine-learning model serving.
- Calibrated probabilities.
- Full worldwide geographic coverage.
- Detailed geographic boundary geometry.
- Automatic player learning recommendations from small samples.

These features must use the established analysis and persistence contracts if
implemented later.

